+| Method | MOTA | IDF1 | IDS | FP | FN | FPS | latency/frame (ms) |
+| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
+| baseline_nn | 1.0000 | 1.0000 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 6701.92 | 0.149 |
+| baseline_kf | 1.0000 | 1.0000 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 1094.63 | 0.914 |
